  <para style="h">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lukwalo gwaPhawuli ekwalila FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filimoni</para>
  <para style="toc3">Filim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lukwalo gwaPhawuli ekwalila</para>
  <para style="mt1">FILIMONI</para>
  <para style="imt">Tjinginiso</para>
  <para style="ip">Lukwalo gufutshwanana gwaFilimoni gwakakwagwa naMpositoli Phawuli (Filimoni 1.1). Phawuli waka eli mujele paakakwala lukwalo igogu, ikoku kuleba kuti angaba agukwala eli kuRoma. Hapa kuli kuti waka eli kuRoma kobva kuti gwakakwagwa mumakole angaba makumi ali kutanhatu ana gole lin'ompela hule kwezwagwa kwaKhirisitu, gunoba lubaka igo zwago gwaangaba akwala lukwalo gwebaKholose.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wakakwala lukwalo igogu egukwalila nlume waka eyi Filimoni. Filimoni waka elinhu wemugubungano, kakale waka alibatezi bebalanda. Phawuli wakawunkwalila ewunkumbila kuti asilange nlanda uwe waka eyi Onesimasi waka atihha Filimoni. Hapa kutobegwa nlayo webaRoma Filimoni waka ebvumigwa langa Onesimasi newumbulaya. Phawuli unohingisa matama otetedza Filimoni kuti awamutjile Onesimasi sehama yaba umwe webagalimoyo, kakale unohhisa nkumbulo wekuti Onesimasi abvumigwe bhatsha Phawuli ipapo Phawuli atjimujele ngentha yendebo mbuya (Filimoni 1.13-14).</para>
  <para style="iot">Nlongoloso Yezwimukati</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unobuyisa Filimoni (Filimoni 1.1-3)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unokumbilila Onesimasi kuti Filimoni awuwamutjile sewumwe webagalimoyo (Filimoni 1.4-21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuli unopedzisa newunzibisa kuti unankumbulo webakumba, ebva ewunzibisa bose banowubuyisa (Filimoni 1.22-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1" />Kubva kuna Phawuli, nsungwa nentha yaKhirisitu Yesu naThimothi hama yedu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHM 1:1">Kuna Filimoni ndhikani wedu nen'hingidzani kan'ompela naswi, <verse eid="PHM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2" />nekuhazwadzi yedu Afiya, naAkhiphasi nghwi kan'ompela naswi, negubungano linonginila munzi uwo.<verse eid="PHM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3" />Ngoni nekunyalala kunobva kuNdzimu Tate bedu naHe Yesu Khirisitu ngakube kumuli.<verse eid="PHM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ludo Nebugalimoyo GwaFilimoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4" />Ndoboka Ndzimu wangu lubaka gose pandinokumbula nekuko mumitembezelo yangu, <verse eid="PHM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5" />ngentha yekuti ndowha nekwebugalimoyo gwawunago muna He Yesu nekweludo gugo kubayengemali bose, <verse eid="PHM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6" />kakale ndotembezela kuti dlidzana kwedu nawe mubugalimoyo kowhokudza luzibo gwekose kwedu kwakanaka kuyapo munaKhirisitu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7" />Ndakawana kuhanha kunjinji nenyaladziwa kwakabva muludo gugo, hama yangu, ngentha yekuti wakamusidzila mimoyo yebayengemali.<verse eid="PHM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumbilila Onesimasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8" />Ngentha yayikoku ke, nekene ndinatjilopa tjikulukulu muna Khirisitu kuti ndikulaye kuti uthame zwakafanila yetiwa, <verse eid="PHM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9" />koga ke ngentha yekuti ndokuda, ndokukumbilisisa, imi Phawuli nhuntana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dzimwe whalo dzoti imi Phawuli milili waKhirisitu</char></note>, kakale ngwenu ndatjiba nsungwa ngentha yaKhirisitu Yesu. <verse eid="PHM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10" />Ndokukumbilisisa ndikumbilila mwana wangu Onesimasi, ngobe ndatjiba tate babe ndilimubusungwa. <verse eid="PHM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11" />Mulubaka gwakapinda waka esina bhatsho kukuli, koga sangwenu watjiba nebhatsho kukuli nekundili bo.<verse eid="PHM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12" />Ndowumbgwiliza kukuli, ndiwumbgwiliza nebuyendasi eyenda nemoyo wangu. <verse eid="PHM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13" />Imi ndandida kuti kadzene agala nemi ngeno, kuyetila kuti andibhatshe alimile mugumbo lilo mulubaka ndili mubusungwa ngentha yendebo mbuya. <verse eid="PHM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14" />Koga ndakumbula kuti andingakuthame tisabvumilana, kuyetila kuti yeta kuko kwakalulama kusibe kwebhata nemasimba, koga kubve muludo gugo.<verse eid="PHM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15" />Pamwe palalanyiwa kukwe nawe kwelubakanyana kwakayetika kudze abgwiliziwe kukuli tjatjose, <verse eid="PHM 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16" />haatjisenlanda koga weepinda nlanda, watjiba gamu linodikala kwazo kundili, kakale linodikala kwazo kwazo nekukuli bo, senhu kakale segamu munaHe.<verse eid="PHM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17" />Hapa kuli kuti unonditola sen'hingi panhu pan'ompela nawe mun'hingo waHe, uwamutjile Onesimasi sekwawunowamutjila imi. <verse eid="PHM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18" />Hapa kuli kuti unatjinhu tjaakakutjinyila, kene enakwelete tjitjo, lipisa imi. <verse eid="PHM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19" />Imi Phawuli ndakwala ikoku neluboko gwangu, ndowholipa, anditohaka kukumbudza kuti iwe wagala nondikweleta butjilo gugo. <verse eid="PHM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20" />Ndizo ke hama yangu, ndohaka tjinondibhatsha kubva kukuli munaHe. Hanhisa moyo wangu muna Khirisitu.<verse eid="PHM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21" />Ndina lebeswa kuti nowhilila, ndakukwalila ndiziba kuti nowhothama tjinopinda tjandaleba. <verse eid="PHM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22" />Kakale undibaakanyile n'umba yebezi, ngobe ndakalingilila kuti ngemitembezelo yenyu, ndowhosunungugwa ahanduka kumuli.<verse eid="PHM 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buyisa Kwebupelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23" />Iphafurasi, wandakasungwa naye ngentha yaKhirisitu Yesu unokubuyisa. <verse eid="PHM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24" />Bamwe banokubuyisa ndebanotobela, ndiMako, naArisitakhasi, naDemasi, naLuka bahingi panhu pan'ompela nemi.<verse eid="PHM 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25" />Ngoni dzaHe Yesu Khirisitu dzibe nemeya dzenyu.<verse eid="PHM 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1" />
</usx>